<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Roosevelt is a 23-year-old man with moderate persistent asthma, well controlled since spring on budesonide-formoterol maintenance-and-reliever therapy (two inhalations twice daily plus as needed), who asked for a same-day visit. Three days ago he developed a runny nose and sore throat after a week of late sessions; a colleague had a cold. Since yesterday he has had wheeze, chest tightness, and a dry cough that woke him twice last night. He followed the yellow zone of his action plan: he has taken 8 reliever inhalations a day on top of his maintenance doses, which help for two to three hours. His home peak flow has been 400 to 440 L/min, against a personal best of 610. A home COVID-19 antigen test this morning was negative. He has not boxed or rowed for two days. He has had no fever above 37.8 °C, no chest pain, and no breathlessness at rest. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Onset</td><td>Cold symptoms three days ago; wheeze since yesterday</td></tr><tr><td>Severity</td><td>Moderate: talks in sentences, peak flow about 70 percent of personal best, night waking twice</td></tr><tr><td>Reliever use</td><td>8 inhalations a day of budesonide-formoterol in addition to maintenance, within the 12-a-day maximum</td></tr><tr><td>Action plan</td><td>Yellow zone followed correctly; called as the plan instructs when not back in the green zone within 48 hours</td></tr><tr><td>Context</td><td>Viral cold; colleague ill; long working days</td></tr><tr><td>Pertinent negatives</td><td>No fever above 37.8 °C, chest pain, sputum change, or breathlessness at rest; COVID-19 antigen test negative</td></tr><tr><td>Exacerbation history</td><td>One oral corticosteroid course from urgent care last winter, before controller therapy; no emergency visits or hospital stays</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

